20,"depth":326,"text":921},{"id":987,"depth":319,"text":988},{"id":1038,"depth":319,"text":1039},"Multi-tenant data isolation in Kinotic with automatic tenant filtering.","md",null,{},{"title":84,"description":1075},"piTcS-1PwSINNC8MIiVRNn-IztFt3jNb_bl7X3jg7j4",[1082,1084],{"title":80,"path":81,"stem":82,"description":1083,"children":-1},"Defining and using custom named queries on entity services in Kinotic.",{"title":88,"path":89,"stem":90,"description":1085,"children":-1},"Versioned data migrations for an application's entities, run during kinotic sync.",1792452083679]